<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Gift animations and ack=
nowledgments</strong> - These directly impact revenue and user satisfaction=
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Stream status changes</=
strong> (live/ended) - Affects core functionality</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Security/moderation act=
