<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Bypassing React</strong=
> for performance-critical rendering</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Using object pools</str=
ong> to eliminate garbage collection pressure</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Implementing intelligen=
